      "writtenOn": "2024-03-25T13:38:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`removeVmInstance` is not available in `VirtualizationService` and it looks like it\u0027s not called anywhere yet. I can work on this part after you finishing the removal part of instance id. I don\u0027t want to add something that has conflict with your future plan.\n\nBtw, do you mind renaming the method to something more specific such as `removeVmInstanceId()`? since here I just created a `VmInstance`, it looks weird that I call `removeVmInstance` immediately after it, and it doesn\u0027t actually remove the `vm_instance`...\n\nIs instance_id useful for non-protected VM?",
      "parentUuid": "8b594080_bb797ed5",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 331,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 331,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "de057a6c6b2149dfa886cf1313f7752566bf18c9",
