      "message": "\u003e can we add a log::warn!() on else arm of the logic, specifying the new instance_id is being created. \n\nYou already have a logging when a new instance_id is created. When this log appears in the stack of service VM log, we\u0027ll know that it\u0027s the first instance.\n\n[1] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/virtualizationservice/src/aidl.rs;l\u003d415;drc\u003d20cb84bffb91d2825445e70a017470224f3b62c8",
